    "title": "How it works ?",
    "description": "Transforming your restaurant's menu into a digital experience is fast 🚀",
    "steps": [
      {
        "h": "Get in touch with our sales team",
        "p": "Contact us via our website, phone, or email. We'll discuss your needs, finalize the subscription details, and you'll send us high-quality photos of your physical menu. [[(Contact informations bellow 👇)]]"
      },
      {
        "h": "We create your digital menu",
        "p": "Our team will digitize your menu, ensuring every detail is captured accurately and attractively for your customers.<br>[[Note! Your menu will be available in 3 languages: Arabic, English, and French.]]"
      },
      {
        "h": "Printing and delivery of custom QR codes",
        "p": "We design a custom QR code with your branding, print it on high-quality, waterproof stickers, and deliver them to your restaurant. Your customers can then scan the QR code to instantly access the menu on their phones."
      }
    ],
